ation. The lighting is good, and the focus is clear. However, the resolution limits the visibility of fine surface textures, particularly on the copper conductors. A macro shot might be useful to discern finer details. I'll need to note that limitation in my final report.", "will_print_thinking": true}, "timestamp": 1767661503211}
